IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-RETNET-RETENTION.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DIM-K               PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 DIM-V               PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 GAMMA-PCT           PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 RETENTION-NORM      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-RETNET.
    IF DIM-K == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF GAMMA-PCT == 0
        MOVE 90 TO GAMMA-PCT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE GAMMA-PCT TO RETENTION-NORM.
    MULTIPLY 100 BY RETENTION-NORM.
    ADD DIM-K TO DIM-V.
    DIVIDE DIM-V INTO RETENTION-NORM.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 RETENTION-NORM.
    WEIGHT 30 GAMMA-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
